                <div class="header-wrapper">
                  <h3 id="impeller">Impeller</h3>
                  <a class="heading-link" href="#impeller" aria-label="Link to 'Impeller' section">#</a>
                </div>
                <ul>
                  <li>
                    [Impeller] new blur: chop off blur extremities by @gaaclarke in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/engine/pull/49574">49574</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    [Flutter GPU] Shader bundle improvements: Uniform structs &amp; member offset reflection, GLES metadata, separate from runtime stage. by @bdero in 
                    <a href="https://github.com/flutter/engine/pull/49485">49485</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    [Impeller] Start and end a frame in the RenderTargetCache for each rendering of an entity in the playgrounds by @jason-simmons in 
                    <a href="https://github.com/flutter/engine/pull/49576">49576</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    [Impeller] Document mip bias. by @bdero in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/engine/pull/49602">49602</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    [Flutter GPU] Track HostBuffer emplacements by offset. by @bdero in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/engine/pull/49618">49618</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    [Impeller] made sure to scale the blur radius by the effect transform by @gaaclarke in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/engine/pull/49645">49645</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    [Impeller] have Hostbuffer write directly to block allocated device buffers. by @jonahwilliams in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/engine/pull/49505">49505</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    [Impeller] Make the shaders loaded by the GLES playground consistent with other playgrounds by @jason-simmons in 
